# Reject malformed node and element input
#
#   - elements: reject nonpositive element numbers and undefined nodes
#   - boundarys: reject negative degrees of freedom
#   - expansions, electricalconductivitys: check nmat before using it
#   - nodalthicknesss: require 1-D/2-D elements and defined nodes
#   - pretensionsections: require the NODE parameter
#   - refinemeshs: require a positive LIMIT
#   - near3d: stop the search once all nodes have been visited
#   - calinput: reject massless contact outside explicit dynamics
#
# Found by fuzzing ccx with malformed variants of 518 input decks under
# AddressSanitizer, and by review of the code around each crash.

diff --git a/ccx_2.23/src/boundarys.f b/ccx_2.23/src/boundarys.f
index 9d75cbc..70e84f6 100644
